We then extended the model to the electroweak theory and incorporated massive dark photons. The aim was to enlarge the Standard Model into the dark sector, consisting of a photon and monopoles. We introduced thereafter the appropriate Higgs mechanisms to generate masses for the heavy mesons and the dark photon. The resulting model exhibits a rich phenomenology. Within this framework, we computed the dark photon contribution to the electron 
