. In addition, future work generalising ECMC with broken velocity symmetry to non-toroidal compact state spaces may provide the framework for broadening cell-horizon ECMC to the Strauss process, stochastic SIR model and other models in computational statistics. Finally, these results are an example of less efficient exploration of the auxiliary (index) space leading to much faster mixing on the original state space. It may be illuminating to characterise this in terms of large-deviations theory.






