2610.00466v1,Inferring radio beams from sparse sampling patterns: a case study with the Murchison Widefield Array,"In this work, we focus only
on the zenith-pointed MW A beam. We expect some techniques we
employ to extend to other pointings as-is, while others will require
modification. Note we have ignored the effects
of gradients, mainly observable in beam nulls. We expect this to
