Outlook




An approach to lattice gauge theories that avoids the problems in non-Abelian
lattice gauge theories discussed in this paper altogether is the one via
quantum link
models 
[
26
, 
27
, 
28
, 
29
]
.
Simulations are performed with an additional, unphysical dimension added and
the target gauge theory is obtained via dimensional
reduction. However, the mechanism of dimensional reduction has been
tested so far only in CP(N)
models 
[
30
, 
31
, 
32
, 
33
]
,
and a practical test in U(1) or SU(N) gauge theories must be
