C.1
 details task selection. Section 
4
 presents the experimental setup and evaluation metrics. Appendix 
D
 provides the prompting strategies and implementation details of CARE, including memory bank construction and retrieval. Detailed experimental results are reported in Appendix 
B
.",cues
