, and rotating solutions.
Throughout this paper, the analyticity properties of the response follow solely from retardedness. It would be interesting to investigate the consequences of full microcausality. For example, in electromagnetism, microcausality constrains combinations of the electric and magnetic susceptibilities of a medium 
[
35
