2609.34954v1,Toward Enhanced Water Detection in SWOT Pixel Clouds using Dynamic Graph Neural Networks,"We aim to achieve this through a two-step graph neural network (GNN) approach that first considers spatial proximity through attention-based learning 
Veličković et al. (2017)
, then dynamically adapts the graph structure based on similarity in the feature space, and finally performs an edge-convolutional step 
(
Wang et al., 2019
)
