VI 
Summary and Conclusions




We conducted a comprehensive study of BS Cas using 22 yr of multi-band photometric data from several observatories, together with 2 yr of high-resolution spectroscopic observations.
The main results are summarized as follows:








1.




The historical light curves spanning 22 yr exhibit significant variations, particularly in the depth of the total eclipse.
Notably, the overall brightness level in 2011 was lower than that observed in 2020.
The variation patterns of 
