As a result of these variations, the light-curve morphology of BS Cas appears to alternate between the A- and W-subtypes.




2.




The first double-lined RV curves were derived from the BF profiles.
An additional third component appears only in the 2020 BF profiles and is absent in the 2018 data.
This spectroscopic component is not expected to be gravitationally bound to the BS Cas system.




